      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Create a <code>Secret</code> object containing the client secret by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc create secret generic <secret_name> --from-literal=clientSecret=<secret> -n openshift-config"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Optional: Apply the following YAML to create the secret:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Secret\nmetadata:\n  name: <secret_name>\n  namespace: openshift-config\ntype: Opaque\ndata:\n  clientSecret: <base64_encoded_client_secret>"} lang="yaml" />
