      <h2 id="identity-provider-creating-configmap_configuring-github-identity-provider" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating a 'ConfigMap'<a href="#identity-provider-creating-configmap_configuring-github-identity-provider" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Create a <code>ConfigMap</code> object in the <code>openshift-config</code> namespace to store the certificate authority bundle that identity providers use to validate secure connections to the remote authentication service.</p>
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
