      <h2 id="identity-provider-github-CR_configuring-github-identity-provider" class="group scroll-mt-20">Sample GitHub CR<a href="#identity-provider-github-CR_configuring-github-identity-provider" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Review the custom resource fields and acceptable values for configuring a GitHub identity provider in OpenShift Container Platform. Use these definitions to set client credentials and access restrictions before applying the configuration to the cluster.</p>
