      <h2 id="add-identity-provider_configuring-github-identity-provider" class="group scroll-mt-20">Adding an identity provider to your cluster<a href="#add-identity-provider_configuring-github-identity-provider" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
